  "description": "We designed the Dreckspatz 3 for flowing trails and pump tracks - you could say: for the school of mountain biking. Here the bike plays to the strengths of a hardtail with lower weight and very good propulsion and guarantees maximum riding fun for the youngsters. The Sixpack 1st Ride components developed based on the needs of kids, paired with selected products from well-known manufacturers and the sophisticated geometry ensure maximum control. In our experience, the 20\" wheels offer the best ratio between easy handling and good rolling behavior for the Dreckspatz age group. Welcome to the mountain bike school. The Dreckspatz 3 is recommended for children between 110 cm and 135 cm (5 to 8 years).",
